        <h1>An ambassador of Jesus Christ, raising disciples for the Kingdom</h1>
        <p class="lead">A trained Medical Doctor, called to be an Apostle of Jesus Christ,
           passionately committed to leading people into a deeper relationship with God
           and equipping believers to fulfil their divine purpose.</p>
      </div>
