    <section class="section section--tight">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="split" data-reveal>
          <div class="split__media">
            <img src="assets/img/feature/editorial-bw.jpg"
                 alt="Dr. Imaobong Odutola preaching" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="split__body prose">
            <p>Dr. Imaobong Odutola’s passion for spreading the Gospel was ignited during
               her high school years through a powerful divine encounter with God that
               marked the beginning of her apostolic assignment. Since then, she has
               remained committed to impacting lives, transforming destinies, and
               advancing the Kingdom of God through the preaching of the Gospel and the
               demonstration of the power of the Holy Spirit.</p>
            <p>She faithfully served as a leader in Christ Embassy from her university
               days. She now leads Light and Grace Ministries, with a mandate to give
               light, the knowledge of salvation and His eternal plan for mankind in the
               demonstration of His Spirit and Power.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
