    <section class="section">
      <span class="watermark" aria-hidden="true">IO</span>
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="rail" data-reveal>
          <span class="eyebrow">The work</span>
          <div class="prose">
            <h2 style="font-size:var(--t-h2);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Revival, prayer and purpose</h2>
            <p>Through Light and Grace Ministries, she and her team host revival
               gatherings in different cities of the world, preaching the gospel of
               Jesus, awakening believers to the person and ministry of the Holy Spirit,
               and witnessing many saved, healed, delivered and empowered.</p>
            <p>She is the convener of <strong>Prophetic Prayer and Praise</strong>, a
               prophetic prayer movement birthed to awaken intimacy with the Lord through
               fervent prayer, heartfelt worship, and deep encounters with the Holy
               Spirit. Through her live prayer platforms, countless lives across nations
               have experienced spiritual awakening, healing, deliverance, restoration,
               and a renewed hunger for God.</p>
            <p>She is also the visionary behind <strong>The Change Woman Global</strong>,
               a divine mandate and global movement commissioned to ignite prayer, awaken
               the power of the Holy Spirit, and stir purpose in women. Through
               conferences, teachings, mentorship and prophetic gatherings, women are
               empowered to rise as vessels of influence, revival, leadership and Kingdom
               impact in their generation.</p>
            <p>An accomplished author, she has written several life-transforming books,
               including <em>Make the Change</em>, <em>The Praying Grace</em> and
               <em>The Laws of Favour</em>, as well as the monthly
               <em>Make the Change Devotional</em>.</p>
            <p>Through her profound, revelatory and Spirit-breathed teachings, Dr.
               Imaobong Odutola continues to raise disciples, awaken revival, and lead
               many into transformational encounters with Jesus Christ and the power of
               the Holy Spirit. Based in Australia, she lives with her husband and three
               children.</p>
